1
00:00:00,888 --> 00:00:05,138
(Leonard(Penny sneezes):)-Getting a cold?
-No, no, it's probably just allergies.

2
00:00:06,518 --> 00:00:08,688
(Leonard:)You want an allergy pill?
I have them all.

3
00:00:08,854 --> 00:00:12,484
(Leonard:)Prescription, nonprescription, foreign,
domestic, experimental.

4
00:00:12,858 --> 00:00:14,238
(Penny:)Do any of them work?

5
00:00:14,401 --> 00:00:17,531
(Leonard:)Not really, I'm just an enthusiast.

6
00:00:18,614 --> 00:00:20,324
[BLOWS NOSE]

7
00:00:22,701 --> 00:00:25,621
[PENNY RETCHES]

8
00:00:27,915 --> 00:00:28,955
(Raj:)Penny?

9
00:00:29,124 --> 00:00:30,874
[TOILET FLUSHES]

10
00:00:31,043 --> 00:00:32,333
(Leonard:)You okay?

11
00:00:32,503 --> 00:00:35,423
PENNY:
Did that sound okay to you?

12
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,840
(Penny:)Do not come in here.

13
00:00:39,301 --> 00:00:40,511
(Leonard:)What's going on?

14
00:00:40,677 --> 00:00:43,597
PENNY: I'm having a tea party.
What do you think is going on?

15
00:00:43,764 --> 00:00:45,894
[PENNY HAWKS AND SPITS]

16
00:00:46,809 --> 00:00:49,059
(Penny:)I think I might have the flu.

17
00:00:49,228 --> 00:00:51,438
[PENNY VOMITS]

18
00:00:51,605 --> 00:00:53,235
(Penny:)Or the plague.

19
00:00:55,692 --> 00:00:59,532
(Leonard:)Well, our plane leaves at 9 a.m.
Do you think you'll feel better by then?

